        <div class="entry-header">
          <span class="entry-org"
            >Shanghai Scientific and Technical Vocational College</span
          >
          <span class="entry-date">Oct 2023 - Jun 2026</span>
        </div>
        <div class="entry-major">
          School of Communication &amp; Electronic Engineering, Information Security
          Technology Application, Associate Degree
        </div>
        <p class="entry-desc">
          <strong>Major Courses:</strong> Network Security, Programming, Algorithms &amp; Data Structures,
          Computer Architecture, Operating Systems, Database Systems, Computer Networks, etc.
        </p>
        <p class="entry-desc" style="margin-top: 4px;">
          <strong>School Awards:</strong> 2023-2025 Dual Academic Year 2nd-Class Scholarship, 2023-2024 Outstanding Student, Outstanding Graduate
        </p>
        <p class="entry-desc" style="margin-top: 4px;">
          <strong>Academic Performance:</strong> GPA 3.41/4.00
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Experience</h2>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="entry-header">
          <span class="entry-org"
            >Moidas | NIHPLOD Division — Digital Development Manager</span
          >
          <span class="entry-date">Oct 2025 - Present</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="project-points">
          <li>Oversaw full lifecycle delivery (planning → development → launch) of 6+ core systems for the brand's Greater China digital presence.</li>
          <li>Established AI-assisted development workflows and design standards, reducing average delivery cycles by over 50%.</li>
          <li>Served as technical lead interfacing with product and marketing teams; established iteration response mechanisms ensuring parallel multi-project delivery.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="entry-header">
          <span class="entry-org"
            >Shanghai Lingang Jinghong Security Technology Development Co., Ltd. — R&amp;D Intern</span
          >
          <span class="entry-date">Jul 2025 - Sep 2025</span>
