            <strong>Official Website &amp; Store:</strong> Modular architecture design ensuring system scalability and brand visual consistency.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Operations &amp; Cost Governance:</strong> Dynamically adjusted server resource allocation based on traffic patterns, achieving cost optimization while maintaining stability.
