          <li>
            <strong>Compliance &amp; Risk Management:</strong> Led ICP filing, privacy policy and user agreement drafting, and data compliance review to ensure regulatory conformance.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Search Visibility:</strong> Implemented SEO &amp; GEO strategies optimizing search engine indexing and generative engine citation display.
          </li>
        </ul>

      </div>

      <div class="project-entry">
        <div class="entry-header">
          <span class="project-name"
            >Shanghai Lingang Jinghong Security Technology Website System</span
          >
          <span class="entry-date">Jul 2025 - Sep 2025</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-meta">
          Independently delivered (full-stack) · Live: <a
            href="https://www.lingangjh.com"
            target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.lingangjh.com</a
