        </div>
        <ul class="project-points">
          <li>
            <strong>Full-Stack Development &amp; Performance Optimization:</strong> Built the company's official website with Next.js full-stack development, paired with a CMS backend for autonomous content management, achieving a first-screen load time under 1.5s.
